[00:13.98]1. The stars that fill the summer night
[00:18.04]Look down from above.
[00:21.50]The beauty of the day and night
[00:24.40]You fashioned with love.
[00:27.92]Your hands prepared the land and sea,
[00:31.86]And ev’rything that came to be
[00:34.98]Brought joy to your heart.
[00:38.90](Chorus)
[00:41.18]There is joy in your creation,
[00:45.18]In the message of salvation,
[00:48.44]And the Paradise to come.
[00:55.22]But to have your love forever
[00:58.64]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[01:02.08]You alone will prove to be
[01:09.00]Our joy eternally.
[01:31.33]2. Jehovah, we have all we need
[01:35.03]To bring us delight—
[01:38.55]The things we hear and touch and see
[01:41.59]And feel deep inside.
[01:45.07]You gave us such a perfect start,
[01:48.55]Eternity in ev’ry heart,
[01:51.95]And joy in our lives.
[01:56.37](Chorus)
[01:58.31]There is joy in your creation,
[02:02.51]In the message of salvation,
[02:05.73]And the Paradise to come.
[02:12.69]But to have your love forever
[02:16.23]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[02:19.71]You alone will prove to be
[02:26.31]Our joy eternally.
[02:41.99](Bridge)
[02:42.01]This joy could not be ours
[02:45.03]Without the gift of your Son.
[02:48.49]His sacrifice has paid the price
[02:51.87]So joy could be ours for all time.
[02:58.67](Chorus)
[02:58.73]There is joy in your creation,
[03:02.13]In the message of salvation,
[03:05.57]And the Paradise to come.
[03:12.71]But to have your love forever
[03:16.23]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[03:19.57]You alone will prove to be
[03:26.37]Our joy eternally.
[03:31.75](Chorus)
[03:33.21]There is joy in your creation,
[03:36.77]In the message of salvation,
[03:40.01]And the Paradise to come.
[03:45.75]But to have your love forever
[03:50.11]Is a real and lasting treasure.
[03:53.59]You alone will prove to be
